{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["And he said — to one who asks him: what is your trade?" "\"For a man acquired me from my youth\" — a man gave me an inheritance of land, and from my youth I work it. And if they ask him: what are the wounds that your father and mother pierced you with? then he will say: I was beaten in the house of my lovers, and I was struck there, in a manner of mockery."], :book :zechariah, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 13, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Zecharia -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/zecharya"] ["1" "http://www.daat.ac.il/daat/olam_hatanah/mefaresh.asp?book=25&perek=5&mefaresh=ezra"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:46:57.039366369Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}